@Account_HostAddress = http://localhost:5027

### List accounts
GET {{Account_HostAddress}}/v1/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Create an account
POST {{Account_HostAddress}}/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "displayName": "Jane Doe"
}

### Health check
GET {{Account_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
